    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pathetic is a short, first person adventure experience with some of narrative elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your way out while dealing with the unfriendly inhabitants of forsaken districts in the void.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674280/extras/8611027cb419070136aa808eaf4dcbc2.poster.avif?t=1737304527\" width=600 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674280/extras/8611027cb419070136aa808eaf4dcbc2.webm?t=1737304527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674280/extras/8611027cb419070136aa808eaf4dcbc2.mp4?t=1737304527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is relatively small location where you need to find a <i>set of items</i> to progress and be able to depart to the next level.<br>There are few locations on each level\u00a0inhabited by unfriendly creatures. Most of those locations contain\u00a0<i>key items</i>, critical for the progression or can provide you the opportunity to boost up the percentage of your <strong>survival</strong> rate.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674280/extras/91da6fb920487d2560c54b95b2123925.poster.avif?t=1737304527\" width=600 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674280/extras/91da6fb920487d2560c54b95b2123925.webm?t=1737304527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674280/extras/91da6fb920487d2560c54b95b2123925.mp4?t=1737304527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong><i>Some</i></strong> statues are portals.<br><span class=\"bb_strike\">No gif here. Find out by yourself</span><br><br>There is no place to hide. <br>Step on the <strong>Pa\u2020h</strong>. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674280/extras/df2b3f70dae0fbc47f1817356783eef0.poster.avif?t=1737304527\" width=600 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674280/extras/df2b3f70dae0fbc47f1817356783eef0.webm?t=1737304527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674280/extras/df2b3f70dae0fbc47f1817356783eef0.mp4?t=1737304527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
